u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">AULI\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"filius\">FILIO\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Quirina\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Quirina\">QUIRINA\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"Eucarpia\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Eucarpia\">EUCARPIA\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"uxor\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"uxor\">UXOR\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":250,"html":251},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text of Manganaro 1989 controlled against the stone.\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"1\">1: \u003Cspan>Manganaro did not record the interpuncts. The space for QV[IR] is extremely limited, and can only have been present if combined in ligature\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"2\">2: \u003Cspan>Manganaro did not record the interpunct. Again, the space to complete VX[OR] is limited, although not impossible, and so perhaps abbreviated.\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":253,"html":254},"translation","\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":256,"html":257},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>  \u003C/p>",{"id":259,"html":260},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1989.0338k \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\u003C/a>